  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.5.32 WebAuthn JSON: PublicKeyCredential.ParseCreationOptionsFromJSON / ParseRequestOptionsFromJSON, ToJSON / ToJSONString, CredentialsContainer Create / Get overloads for the parsed options (passkeys with any server speaking the standard base64url JSON); PublicKeyCredential<TResponse> derives from a new non-generic PublicKeyCredential. v3.5.31 EncodedAudioChunkType, EncodedVideoChunkType and GPUStencilOperation reach Javascript as their strings (\"key\", \"increment-clamp\"); they were sent as C# names (\"Key\") and the browser refused new EncodedAudioChunk / EncodedVideoChunk. DisplayMediaStreamOptions.WindowAudio (exclude / system / window). MediaDevices.GetUserMedia(bool, bool) sends MediaStreamConstraints. v3.5.30 PointerEvent.Width/Height are double (int threw on a fractional touch contact), DataTransfer.Types + new DataTransfer(); ReadableStream.PipeThrough for CompressionStream / DecompressionStream / TextDecoderStream / TextEncoderStream (+ TextEncoderStream); WebGPU GPUExternalTextureDescriptor.ColorSpace and sampler type serialize correctly; GPUCopyExternalImageSourceInfo.FlipY; AudioScheduledSourceNode double Start/Stop overloads.",
